# Build context for api/Dockerfile (built from the repository root): only the API's sources and manifests.
# Everything else, including every .env file, node_modules and tests, stays out of the context.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!api/package.json
!api/production.env
!api/src/
!api/kit/*/package.json
!api/kit/*/src/
